  2. Unable to perform Magnetic Resonance Imaging(MRI) examination and/or there are contraindications for MRI examination, such as prosthesis, orthotics or orthodontics, which will interfere with the volume analysis of the target Plexiform neurofibroma( PN) on MRI;
